---
title: Sequence Diagrams - (a) Installment Payment Loop, (b) Income Verification
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Borrower
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as Backend API
    participant SC as LocalBank
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    rect rgb(245,245,245)
        Note over U,DB: (a) Installment payment loop
        loop For each scheduled installment
            U->>FE: Pay installment N
            FE->>API: POST /installments/N/pay
            API->>SC: processInstallment(loanId, N)
            Note right of SC: CEI pattern
            SC-->>API: emit InstallmentPaid
            API->>DB: UPDATE status=PAID
            API-->>U: receipt + next due date
        end
        Note right of SC: LoanClosed + SBT bump
        Note right of API: overdue via Automation (Ph II)
    end

    rect rgb(238,238,238)
        Note over U,DB: (b) Income verification
        U->>FE: Upload income document
        FE->>API: POST /income
        alt API pull
            Note right of API: fetch transactions
        else Manual
            Note right of API: queue for operator
        end
        API->>DB: INSERT income_proof
        API-->>U: verified + SBT score bump
    end
